{{!--
Template: Link

Purpose:
- Renders hyperlink display content.

Inputs:
- id: link id.
- href: link target.
- target/rel: link browsing attributes.
- children: rendered link content.
--}}
<a{{{attr "id" id}}}{{{attr "href" href}}}{{{attr "target" target}}}{{{attr "rel" rel}}}>{{{children}}}</a>
